alaian lagi berpaling (daripadanya).", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "ٱقْتَرَبَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/a7a17ad8011fcacc46fc.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "he/it drew near", "bs": "približio se", "tr": "yaklaştı", "fr": "il s'est approché", "id": "dia telah mendekat", "ur": "وہ قریب ہوا", "bn": "সে নিকটবর্তী হলো", "fa": "نزدیک شد"}}, {"text": "لِلنَّاسِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "حِسَابُهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "غَفْلَةٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُّعْرِضُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "54:1", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hiya", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4847.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "The hour drew nigh and the moon was rent in twain.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Kıyamet saati yaklaştı, Ay yarıldı.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "پاس آئی قيامت اور شق ہوگیا چاند", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Telah dekat datangnya saat itu dan telah terbelah bulan.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "ٱقْتَرَبَتِ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/bc3f15870e9d2ddc9df1.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "približio se", "en": "has drawn near", "tr": "yaklaştı", "fr": "s'est rapprochée", "id": "telah dekat", "ur": "قریب آ گئی", "bn": "নিকটবর্তী হয়েছে", "fa": "نزدیک شده است"}}, {"text": "ٱلسَّاعَةُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱنشَقَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْقَمَرُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "96:19", "tense": "imperative", "category": {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", 